WEBVTT

00:07:27.026 --> 00:07:30.946
Now look, we can all look at 2020 and 2021

00:07:30.946 --> 00:07:35.493
and understand that, oof,
we can't really predict what happens.

00:07:35.534 --> 00:07:36.577
(Laughs)

00:07:36.577 --> 00:07:37.995
We don't really know.

00:07:37.995 --> 00:07:40.289
But what we do know is right here.

00:07:41.123 --> 00:07:44.502
What are the things
that make us feel good,

00:07:44.543 --> 00:07:46.504
the things that scare us,

00:07:46.545 --> 00:07:49.715
the things that make us feel
more connected to each other?

00:07:51.342 --> 00:07:52.593
You know, today ...

00:07:54.136 --> 00:07:55.262
is a gift.

00:07:56.388 --> 00:07:58.265
That’s why they call it the present.

00:07:58.307 --> 00:07:59.350
(Laughter)

00:07:59.391 --> 00:08:01.977
I didn't make that up,
but it's so corny and I love it.